    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"感染者監視隊\"] あがっ……！！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "感染者監視隊",
        "content": "あがっ……！！"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"タルラ\"] その手はまだ切り落とさずにおいてやったんだ……立て！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "タルラ",
        "content": "その手はまだ切り落とさずにおいてやったんだ……立て！"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_082\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"感染者監視隊\"] ……こ、これで済んだと思うなよ！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "感染者監視隊",
        "content": "……こ、これで済んだと思うなよ！"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"タルラ\"] なら今すぐその舌を切り落としてやる。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "タルラ",
        "content": "なら今すぐその舌を切り落としてやる。"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_082\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=0.4, xstrength=0, ystrength=8, vibrato=30, randomness=30, fadeout=true, block=false)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "0.4,",
